{"id":646,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>为拓宽优质生源渠道、提升学校招生影响力，助力高三学子科学填报志愿，近日，中北大学机械工程学院由王洪福、岳鸿志、杨辉、李涛涛、杜文华、边国旗、靳国良等宣讲教师组成的宣讲团队奔赴大同、山东多地重点高中，开展2026年高考招生专项宣讲活动。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TU4-tYM7QfLRLYMjzMknNCDUNn7nRrw2oRvbolUZLmrkL8C0gihFp2hmCIa0okyaMYh2USyiUl7aUz9inzrknll8UmL8L8UsU87PLzLZU8rFLlCPnz-iMNVFL4lin77Jv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLPg4LbL4CsgtA8pUXcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1131&nid=39367&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/807FA5AA0A85E5BEE4B343D7CA1138CE/1F1E256A/355DA\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 190px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TU4-tYM7QfLRLYMjzMknNCDUNn7nRrw2oRvbolUZLmrkL8C0gihFp2hmCIa0okyaMYh2USyiUl7aUz9inzrknll8UmL8L8UsU87PLzLZU8rFLlCPnz-iMNVFL4lin77Jv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLPg4LbL4CsgtA8pUXcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1131&nid=39367&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Tnm-tPMll8nRUPMjllsnzGsoRvZnNWwRMR-ZozlsUmQRLRl0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyZMShkMkyZnm7bLmGDUzL4U8L8ozQ7M7rRLRU8LzG8LlVFLmv8M7CZLlVFL4QkLz-Jv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLPg4LbL4CsgtA8pUXcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1131&nid=39367&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/785B48F19206A33CC496D4EC0441041A/2744F81A/36B12\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 188px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Tnm-tPMll8nRUPMjllsnzGsoRvZnNWwRMR-ZozlsUmQRLRl0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyZMShkMkyZnm7bLmGDUzL4U8L8ozQ7M7rRLRU8LzG8LlVFLmv8M7CZLlVFL4QkLz-Jv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLPg4LbL4CsgtA8pUXcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1131&nid=39367&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TnzAt7nmlPMNW7UjN7Yozf2M4l4Um7wDU46VM4liUlLZMRU0gihFp2hmCIa0Lkhkokh2nSyPnzliM4rVnmn2Mz7sMR-ZMmvYo7nVLzUYMzQFL4UYLRvaU8VFL4vDn7CJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLPg4LbL4CsgtA8pUXcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1131&nid=39367&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0B8FE1E5575EF4F5174286728DE14256/342070CA/376DF\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 187px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TnzAt7nmlPMNW7UjN7Yozf2M4l4Um7wDU46VM4liUlLZMRU0gihFp2hmCIa0Lkhkokh2nSyPnzliM4rVnmn2Mz7sMR-ZMmvYo7nVLzUYMzQFL4UYLRvaU8VFL4vDn7CJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_I